releaseAssets.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the {PERPEX_ROLE}
│   └── it should revert with {AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller has {PERPEX_ROLE}
    ├── when assets is zero
    │   └── it should revert with {POOL__INVALID_RELEASE_AMOUNT} error
    ├── when assets exceeds the current reserved assets
    │   └── it should revert with {POOL__INVALID_RELEASE_AMOUNT} error
    └── when assets is valid
        ├── it should decrease the reserved assets
        └── it should emit the {AssetsReleased} event
